      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix: show workboard cards before task enrichment",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nWorkboard could render as an empty board while the card list was already available. The loader waited for task enrichment through `tasks.list` before publishing `workboard.cards.list` results into UI state. On installations with a large task ledger, `tasks.list` can be slow enough that operators see `0` cards and a long refreshing state even though Workboard data is intact.\n\n## What Changed\n\n- Publish canonical cards, boards, and statuses immediately after `workboard.cards.list` returns.\n- Keep task enrichment as a follow-up step so task metadata can still attach after `tasks.list` resolves.\n- Preserve the existing live-refresh interaction guard: linked/passive refreshes still defer early publication while a card is dragged, edited, or another write is active.\n- Add controller coverage for delayed task enrichment.\n- Preserve existing task links during replacement enrichment so loaded cards do not lose their task badges while a new `tasks.list` call is still pending.\n- Add Chromium E2E coverage proving a card is visible while `tasks.list` is intentionally held pending, then remains visible after enrichment settles.\n\n## Evidence\n\nFocused unit/browser checks run locally on the PR head:\n\n```text\nPATH=/opt/homebrew/bin:$PATH ../node_modules/.bin/vitest run --config vitest.config.ts src/lib/workboard/index.test.ts\n-> 179 passed\n\nPATH=/opt/homebrew/bin:$PATH ../node_modules/.bin/vitest run --config vitest.config.ts src/pages/workboard/view.test.ts\n-> 68 passed\n\nPLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE_PATH=\"/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome\" PATH=/opt/homebrew/bin:$PATH ./node_modules/.bin/vitest run --config test/vitest/vitest.ui-e2e.config.ts ui/src/pages/workboard/workboard.e2e.test.ts -t \"renders cards while task enrichment is still pending\"\n-> 1 passed | 3 skipped\n\ngit diff --check\n-> clean\n```\n\nBrowser proof artifacts from the E2E run:\n\n- `.artifacts/control-ui-e2e/workboard/delayed-task-enrichment-card-visible.png` shows the card visible while `tasks.list` is still pending and the toolbar still says Refreshing.\n- `.artifacts/control-ui-e2e/workboard/delayed-task-enrichment-settled.png` shows the same card after `tasks.list` resolves and the toolbar returns to Refresh.\n\n## Risk / Notes\n\nThis change only affects transient Control UI state publication. It does not change Workboard storage, gateway RPCs, task ledger behavior, config, auth, or lifecycle write semantics.\n",
        "branch": "codex/workboard-loader-unblock-20260717",
